# Audit trail

After any meaningful development change (structure, docs, config, code, plans):

1. Append an entry to `docs/audit/CHANGELOG.md` (newest first under the current version heading, or a dated Unreleased section).
2. Each item: date, short title, what changed, why, paths touched.
3. Keep entries factual and free of tooling provenance fluff.
4. Use skill `audit-trail` when unsure of the format.
